{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/7670d32ea9a06359e77dd640dc682db7.webp?t=1773091185\" width=100 height=15 /></span>\u00a0takes the social deduction formula and rebuilds it for modern multiplayer. No server setup. No mods. No external voice tools. Just launch, invite your friends, and start playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fully integrated voice chat, powerful traitor abilities, deep customization, and chaotic weapons, BETRAYED gives you control over how intense \u2014 or how ridiculous \u2014 your rounds become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/23f1ff864570b5d66661d9ee1017c225.avif?t=1773091185\" width=1200 height=300 /></span><strong>Built-In Voice Chat. No Workarounds.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global &amp; Proximity Voice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate Death Voice Channel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless round flow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay immersed \u2014 even after you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/09b0711a8166c816dd39d43a309055e2.avif?t=1773091185\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/05a79faf9d8766e37fc5ce50c6169454.poster.avif?t=1773091185\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/05a79faf9d8766e37fc5ce50c6169454.webm?t=1773091185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/05a79faf9d8766e37fc5ce50c6169454.mp4?t=1773091185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons That Actually Change The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault rifles? Sure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But also:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portable cannons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket-powered baseball bats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightning strikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airstrikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landmines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleporters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invisibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes\u2026 car-shooting shotguns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just deduction. It\u2019s escalation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/157736ebd003142fca008087c1f06be5.avif?t=1773091185\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/b5fe7bfd52e7866b83d8e8d32a69711d.poster.avif?t=1773091185\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/b5fe7bfd52e7866b83d8e8d32a69711d.webm?t=1773091185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/b5fe7bfd52e7866b83d8e8d32a69711d.mp4?t=1773091185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maps With Personality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deserts to arctic storms.<br>Low gravity arenas.<br>Steep fortresses.<br>Tight office corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location changes how betrayal unfolds.<br>More maps are in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/9d61f90a26eb9acc305abb0db5a960bf.avif?t=1773091185\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/c37ee62d8883f8c5e470cb5f2a3bd9ce.poster.avif?t=1773091185\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/c37ee62d8883f8c5e470cb5f2a3bd9ce.webm?t=1773091185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/c37ee62d8883f8c5e470cb5f2a3bd9ce.mp4?t=1773091185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaos You Can Feel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll physics that turn every explosion into a highlight clip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/c9324b4a43d7c6895cdef0ec72f4f571.avif?t=1773091185\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/52b98b8907a3ac0fcb27ace8715e0336.poster.avif?t=1773091185\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/52b98b8907a3ac0fcb27ace8715e0336.webm?t=1773091185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/52b98b8907a3ac0fcb27ace8715e0336.mp4?t=1773091185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Without Limits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 91,000,000 unique character combinations \u2014 and growing. <br>Create something ridiculous, terrifying, or completely unique. It\u2019s your chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/728ebf89cbf281c865af82207cb37ff0.avif?t=1773091185\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/ec46a64568c5d230f38030c09a9d81f6.poster.avif?t=1773091185\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/ec46a64568c5d230f38030c09a9d81f6.webm?t=1773091185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/ec46a64568c5d230f38030c09a9d81f6.mp4?t=1773091185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full control over your server.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust Traitor ratios, enable or disable roles, tweak timers, economy, tasks, and weapon chaos to shape the experience exactly how your group wants it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your custom presets and switch between them anytime \u2014 from casual party nights to high-stakes paranoia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No setup. No friction.<br>Launch, invite, and let CHAOS happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/8783cf20cb205202b5ef1321995f1459.avif?t=1773091185\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trust No One</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Traitor, blend in. Lie convincingly. Earn Blood Credits, buy deadly tools, set traps, strike from the shadows \u2014 and erase the evidence before anyone notices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Innocent, complete tasks, watch your back, and figure out who\u2019s faking it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Inspector, investigate corpses, track the killer\u2019s last movements, and expose the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, it\u2019s not about who shoots first \u2014 it\u2019s about who lies best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why BETRAYED?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No setup.<br>No friction.<br>Full customization.<br>Modern systems.<br>Pure social chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now \u2014 and bring 15 friends.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2873490?t=1773091185","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2873490?t=1773091185","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/431b0db511ecca58a8acd43f83a4b854ff2a53fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773091185","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/431b0db511ecca58a8acd43f83a4b854ff2a53fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773091185","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"You will be able to use \"low poly\" stylized guns and rifles in Betrayed to shoot at other players or NPC animals 