aranoia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No setup. No friction.<br>Launch, invite, and let CHAOS happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/extras/8783cf20cb205202b5ef1321995f1459.avif?t=1773091185\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trust No One</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Traitor, blend in. Lie convincingly. Earn Blood Credits, buy deadly tools, set traps, strike from the shadows \u2014 and erase the evidence before anyone notices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Innocent, complete tasks, watch your back, and figure out who\u2019s faking it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Inspector, investigate corpses, track the killer\u2019s last movements, and expose the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, it\u2019s not about who shoots first \u2014 it\u2019s about who lies best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why BETRAYED?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No setup.<br>No friction.<br>Full customization.<br>Modern systems.<br>Pure social chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now \u2014 and bring 15 friends.</p>","developers":["Almost Good Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873490/bfaa1c143e99f73a9d1c0905d758e61ef554bfb7/header.jpg?t=1773091185","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2873490/709189/985b3e896fa2b9b9a95c6bb047b8a877f2bcf33f/1750949551/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773002614","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2873490/709189/985b3e896fa2b9b9a95c6bb047b8a877f2bcf33f/1750949551/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773002